A heredoc and the public API produce the same filtered total.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight aggregate --accounts Assets:Cash --include-total --format json <<'LEDGER'
commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-01 Opening balance
  Assets:Cash  100 SEK
  Equity:Opening
LEDGER

========== API ==========

aggregate({ accounts: ['Assets:Cash'], includeTotal: true })

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Cash",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "100"
  },
  {
    "account": "Total",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "isTotal": true,
    "quantity": "100"
  }
]
